# When deploying the frontend on a different origin than the API server
# (e.g. GitHub Pages frontend + Replit API), set this to your API server's
# root URL. The frontend automatically appends "/api" to reach the endpoints.
#
# Example:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://ballpointone.replit.app
#
# This makes all API calls go to https://ballpointone.replit.app/api/...
